OL,3,AAuthor says there were 'real concerns'
OL,4,Aabout David Walliams within publishing
OL,5,Aindustry
OL,6,
OL,7,FAuthor Chloe Combi has said she had
OL,8,Fheard rumours that there were "real
OL,9,Fconcerns" about David Walliams's
OL,10,Fbehaviour within the publishing
OL,11,Findustry more than a decade ago.
OL,13,FCombi told BBC News she had heard there
OL,14,Fwere allegations about his "behaviour
OL,15,Faround young female staff" and says she
OL,16,Fwas told in 2015 to warn schools that
OL,17,Fhe was "not an appropriate booking".
